# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day34

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| substantial | 상당한, 상당히 큰 | The region experienced a substantial increase in population. |
| decline | 감소하다, 감소 | The population began to decline. |
| fluctuate | 변동하다 | Temperatures fluctuate throughout the year. |

---

## Synonyms

### substantial
→ considerable / significant

### decline
→ decrease / diminish

### fluctuate
→ vary / change irregularly

---

## Useful Collocations

substantial increase
→ 상당한 증가

substantial amount
→ 상당한 양

decline in population
→ 인구 감소

decline rapidly
→ 급격히 감소하다

fluctuate over time
→ 시간에 따라 변동하다

